  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound cooked potatoes",
    "4 ounces self-rising flour",
    "2 ounces butter",
    "0.5 pinch salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Heat a lightly greased griddle or cast iron skillet over medium-high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1HW_Y0jXc7X4tPyzRLmMfmwlnEg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241419-Potato-Scones-ddms-4x3-step1-92d5f660ae23420d8a4a35283ad77056.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241419/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash potatoes with flour, butter, and salt in a large bowl until a stiff dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3W8N2DupHJGeoAVAN_Y3bNKMW2c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241419-Potato-Scones-ddms-4x3-step3-fbaa348cb29c432fb63d9b1b50a6f65b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241419/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a lightly floured work surface. Knead dough lightly and roll dough out to a 1/2-inch-thick circle. Cut into 6 equal wedges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KpSnmT_9xnQ6NQFYeGjlJ4JuLd0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241419-Potato-Scones-ddms-4x3-step6-afb17f0308104672918c5ded9e013d39.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241419/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, cook scones on the hot griddle until golden brown, 4 to 5 minutes per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f3CWDpD-17U_Ox0td0eWtxLeJVU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241419-Potato-Scones-ddms-4x3-step7-b65b45b948a34c35bcfb6355d856e815.jpg"
